-- Only LPs named in those dumps (records field_path=limitedPartners, or leads with theme limitedPartners). Nothing added.
-- confirmed = named commitment/relationship in a readable source; lead = snippet/aggregator/alleged/inferred/not yet approved.
-- Not loaded: StepStone (sub 12) NYSTRS/ERSRI/CalPERS = consultant clients, not LP commitments; Valor "nine unnamed pensions";
--   Blackstone NYC-pension lead = secondary-sale buyer, not LP; Adams Street Leicestershire/LGPS Central (no source page).
